# Change log
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file. Here we
will document changes to major releases only (not point relases). 

## [0.0.3] -- 2024-04-29
  - Args in main pipeline inherited from SCTprocess.
  - Added helper function to automatically select N PCs explaining a given amount
    of variance (default 90%).
  - Made helpers and main pipeline platform-agnostic. Now user should
    specificy whether data is from 10x or Smart-seq2 platforms.
  - Added citation. 
  - Add centroid calculation and distance computations as additional utility
    functions.

## [0.0.2] -- 2024-02-05
  - Added outlier-based detection of low quality cells.
  - Fixed bugs inherent to change to Seurat v5.
  - Added more informative QC plots including the top N most expressed genes.
  - Fixed issues with package function imports when running doItAll.
  - Implemented conversion of output Seurat object into Anndata object for RNA
    and SCT assays.
  
